# Settings for one checkout, loaded by "extra_configs = *-local.ini" in every example's
# platformio.ini: the enrolment secret (platformio-secrets-local.ini, symlinked in by the OTA
# build harness) and a developer's own debug flags. Never committed - this library ships to the
# PlatformIO registry and the Arduino Library Manager, so a secret landing here is published.
*-local.ini
